{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"sulphur_lump","model_identifier":"sulphur_lump","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## sulphur_lump\n\nCarried load, mineral.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.2..4.7, y -3.0..2.6, z -7.0..0.1 (size 8.9 x 5.6 x 7.0 u = 25 x 16 x 20 cm).\nSulphur lump: crumbly bright yellow crust lumps. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## sulphur_lump\n\nCarried load, mineral.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.2..4.7, y -3.0..2.6, z -7.0..0.1 (size 8.9 x 5.6 x 7.0 u = 25 x 16 x 20 cm).\nSulphur lump: crumbly bright yellow crust lumps. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"rock","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.0,-3.0,-6.5],"to":[3.0,2.0,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,0,18.0,5.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18,0,24.0,5.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[24,0,30.0,5.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,6,6.0,11.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,6.0,6.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[6,0,12.0,6.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d76d092d-1c62-501b-aa36-3bbf82530930"},{"name":"rock_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"fro